{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S01、S05这类短停留页面，未标时出现的感受词偏密，容易让人来不及扫完；X的左右分栏更利于快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"整体选Y，因为加亮词让每段的情绪支点更容易被抓住，而话语中的因果关系和心理变化也交代得更充分，尤其是从害怕给对方负担，到害怕对方不再需要自己，再到接受不确定性的变化，层次很清楚。更重要的是，Y的感受不只是给情绪贴标签，还通过声线、力度、呼吸、光影和身体感受的细微变化，把音乐进程与人物心境联系起来，前后呼应也更丰富。X胜在一眼扫过更轻松，但不少细腻变化被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "353b5d22-88a7-46ba-8a70-73f92f7593ba", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231304487114Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:14:21.824456+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "68d96cb52d22babe7871f2223de662629918ec736dfec3c47731859d7c713b1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\